# Acme UI (Linear-style minimal SaaS)

Full contract: @DESIGN.md · project map: @AGENTS.md

- Colours only via tokens from `src/styles/tokens.scss` (`$card`, `$border`, `$fg-muted`, `$accent`…).
  No hex/rgb in components. New colour = CSS variable in **both** theme blocks of
  `src/styles/globals.scss` + alias in `tokens.scss`.
- Separate surfaces with 1px `$border`; shadows only on modal/drawer/toast.
- One `Button variant="primary"` per view; statuses with `Count tone` (mint=success, lemon=pending,
  rose=failed, sky=info, lavender=highlight).
- Reuse `src/components/ui.tsx` + `primitives.tsx` (Button, Badge, Panel, PageHeader, FormField,
  Input, Select, SearchBox, Segmented, PillTabs, Switch, Modal, Drawer, Empty, Meter, Sparkline,
  Avatar, AppChip). Feedback via `useApp().toast(...)` after every mutation.
- Layout: pages use `<Page>` (left-aligned, full width) → `PageHeader` → KPI row → `Panel`s.
- Responsive via mixins in `src/styles/_breakpoints.scss`: `bp.phone` (<640: drawer menu, one
  column, bottom-sheet dialogs, tables in `TableWrap` + `.hideSm`), `bp.tablet` (icon rail),
  `bp.below-desktop` (stack split grids). No raw media queries.
- Arrow functions only; `aria-label` on icon buttons; sentence-case copy.
- Done = `npm run build` passes + checked in light & dark at 390 / 820 / 1440 px, no console errors.
